  <description>
    An x500 quadcopter with a 360 deg 2D lidar (LD19 / RPLIDAR C1 class:
    360 samples, 0.15-12 m, 10 Hz) on a short mast above the propeller
    plane, for horizontal obstacle avoidance.
  </description>
</model>
